# ThaiSLM — what goes to GitHub and what does not
#
#   IN the repo : code (modules/, scripts/, GCP/script/, webapp/), docker-compose.yml, lab.ipynb, reports (result_reporting/*.md|pdf|png),
#                 vocab/, the deployable model (models/: *.pt / *.onnx / *.npz / *.task via Git LFS — see .gitattributes), eval bank in artifacts/,
#                 small derived files a collaborator needs to continue (calibration/spotting/grammar json, metric reports).
#   NOT in repo : any data — raw video, poses/landmarks, feature shards, test videos, scraped metadata, secrets.
#                 Data lives on S3 (s3://dsi490-lake-signdata/{raw_data,data_prep}/); cloud_s3/ is its local mirror.

# ---- secrets / local machine
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.aws/
*.pem
*.key
credentials*.json
.claude/

# ---- data (source of truth = S3)
cloud_s3/
cloud_gcs/
raw_data/
add-data/
data_prep/
data_test/
cache/
cache/live_requests/
Boom/phase2.2/capture_metadata.csv
metadata/
state/
logs/
*.mp4
*.avi
*.mov
*.mkv
*.webm
*.wav
*.mp3
*.vtt
*.zip

# ---- derived data inside artifacts/ (poses, feature caches, packed shards, per-clip embeddings)
artifacts/**/pose/
artifacts/**/pose_*/
artifacts/cache/
artifacts/tracks/
artifacts/backgrounds/
artifacts/gcs/data/
artifacts/v5/gcs/data/
artifacts/runs/**/*.npz
artifacts/runs/**/*.npy
artifacts/runs/**/*.pkl
artifacts/runs/**/*.pt
artifacts/v5/runs/**/*.npz
artifacts/v5/runs/**/*.npy
artifacts/v5/runs/**/*.pkl
artifacts/v5/runs/**/*.pt
artifacts/**/*.parquet
!artifacts/pretrained/**

# ---- inference outputs that contain frames of people (keep result.json / subtitle.srt / timeline.png)
result_reporting/**/segments.jpg
result_reporting/**/*.jpg
!result_reporting/*.jpg
result_reporting/inference_cli/

# ---- Python / Jupyter / OS noise
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
*.log
*.tmp
*.part
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/

# per-clip embeddings computed for evaluation (derived from data)
artifacts/eval/emb_*.npy
artifacts/eval/emb_*.npz
# public Uni-Sign checkpoints: rebuild with `python main.py pretrained`
artifacts/pretrained/unisign_*.pt

prompt/*

# ---- web demo build outputs (also in webapp/web/.gitignore)
webapp/web/node_modules/
webapp/web/.next/
webapp/web/out/
webapp/web/public/mediapipe/
webapp/web/public/models/
*.tsbuildinfo
node_modules/

# ---- stray files from Windows shells (`> $null` in cmd creates a file)
/$null

# ---- reverse part (reverse_text2sign/): derived data, local caches and web build output
reverse_text2sign/data/
reverse_text2sign/service/web/node_modules/
reverse_text2sign/service/web/dist/
reverse_text2sign/service/web/public/avatar.vrm
reverse_text2sign/result_reporting/review/renders/
reverse_text2sign/prompt/*



word/

# Local experiment environments and tool caches
Boom/venv-sign2say/
Boom/work/*venv/
Boom/work/swift-cache/
Boom/work/matplotlib/
Boom/**/runtime_packages/
Boom/**/runtime_wheels/
Boom/data_sources/e_tsl/priority_videos/
Boom/data_sources/e_tsl/thumbnails/
